{"title": "沙发上的哲学家", "index": 11, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_9\" id=\"filepos95002\"><span class=\"calibre1\">第四章</span></p><blockquote class=\"calibre_17\"><blockquote class=\"calibre_18\">我们立足于过去的经验，常对现在抱有期望，又担心事实与自己的期望不符。</blockquote></blockquote><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_10\"></div>\n</body>"}]}